# c:\dev workspace root -- only track documentation, not code repos or state.
# Each subdirectory is its own git repo. This repo tracks ONLY workspace-level docs.

# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow workspace-level documentation
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!CREDO.md
!ECOSYSTEM.md
!MISSION.md
!README.md
!SESSION-BOOTSTRAP.md
!WORKSPACE-INDEX.md
!WORKSPACE-ROADMAP.md
!PRODUCT.md

# Allow project-docs directory (workspace-level deliverables, not repo-specific)
# NOTE: project-docs/ and docs/ are their own git repos. Do not embed them.
# Reference them from the workspace docs instead.

# Do NOT track:
# public/         (each repo is its own git repo)
# state/          (private, proprietary)
# secrets/        (never)
# protected/      (never)
# _*/             (scratch, temp, cache)
# *.json          (generated maps)
# *.png *.jpg     (screenshots)
# data/           (runtime data)
# tests/          (workspace-level test scratch)
# tools/          (workspace tools)
# scratch/ tmp/   (ephemeral)
